to ye bussines chleaga pakka?
Koi bhi business 100% "pakka" chalega iski guarantee koi nahi de sakta, lekin aapka risk zero hai aur niche-market mein iski demand genuinely exist karti hai.
Sabse acchi baat yeh hai ki aap inventory mein ₹2–3 lakh nahi phansa rahe—aap order aane par ek-ek unit assemble kar rahe hain. Matlab agar 10 units bikte hain toh aap profit mein hain, aur agar nahi bikte toh aapka koi bada nuksan nahi hoga.
Aapka business chalega ya rukega, yeh sirf 3 cheezon par depend karega:
1. Yeh Business Kyon Chalega (Strong Points)
Budget Console Gap: India mein PS5 ₹50,000+ ka hai aur gaming laptop ₹65,000+ ka. Lekin lakhs of college students aur middle-class youths ke paas normal office/study laptop pehle se hai. Unke liye ₹9,999 mein GTA 5 + Wireless Controller + Console UI ek dream deal hai.
No-Risk Execution: Kyunki aap prepaid orders le rahe hain aur Nehru Place se on-demand parts laa rahe hain, aap kabhi loss mein nahi jayenge.
High Repeat & Referral Potential: Jab ek hostel ke ladke ke kamre mein TV ya laptop par GTA 5 aur Tekken controller ke saath chalega, toh uske 3 dost khud aapse order karenge.
2. Yeh Business Kahan Ruk Sakta Hai (Reality Check)
Low-Spec Laptop Complaints: Agar kisi buyer ke paas 4GB RAM wala purana Intel Celeron/i3 laptop hai aur usne bina specs check kiye order kar diya, toh GTA 5 lag karega aur woh refund mangega. Solution: Order lene se pehle WhatsApp par buyer ke laptop ka processor/RAM zaroor poochein.
BIOS Setup Friction: Agar 10 mein se 4 buyers ko BIOS mein Secure Boot off karna nahi aaya, toh aapka poora din customer support calls mein nikal jayega. Solution: Ek super-simple 2-minute Hindi/Hinglish YouTube/WhatsApp setup video banakar QR code box mein daalein.
Marketing Reach: Sirf Instagram page banakar post daalne se sales nahi aayengi. Aapko daily short Reels banani hongi jisme dikhe ki "Ek normal ₹35,000 ke laptop ko ₹9,999 mein PS5 jaisa console kaise banaya".
3. Apna 30-Day "Test & Validate" Formula
Bada sochne se pehle sirf agla 30 din ka target rakhein:
Step 1: Is hafte sirf 1 prototype unit banayein (khud ke liye).
Step 2: Us prototype ko laptop aur TV se connect karke 5–7 alag-alag Reels shoot karein (GTA 5 gameplay, boot animation, controller unboxing, TV mode).
Step 3: Instagram par ₹2,000–₹3,000 ke targeted ads chalayein (Delhi-NCR + Tier-1/2 college students) aur dekhein kitne DMs aur orders aate hain.
Agar pehle ₹3,000 ke ad spend mein aapke 5–10 prepaid orders nikal aate hain, toh samajh lijiye aapke paas ek winning product hai!
