The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt: Duniya ke sabse famous open-world RPG games mein se ek hai. Controller ke saath khelne mein bahut mazaa aata hai aur sale/key sites par ₹300 – ₹450 mein mil jata hai.
2. Fighting & Multiplayer Party Games (Console & TV Ke Liye Best)
Agar buyer laptop ko TV se connect karke doston ke saath 2 controllers par khelna chahta hai, toh yeh games GTA 5 se bhi zyada bikte hain:
Tekken 7: India ke har gamer ka favourite fighting game! Normal laptops par bhi aaram se chalta hai aur iski Steam key ₹350 – ₹500 mein mil jati hai.
Mortal Kombat 11: Zabardast graphics aur 2-player local fighting ke liye best hai. Key price approx. ₹300 – ₹450.
