15-minute mein Master Image flash karne aur Steam + Epic + XPlay UI setup karne ka step-by-step order
Apne XPlay Prototype SSD par Master Image flash karne aur Steam, Epic Games, aur custom XPlay UI setup karne ka exact step-by-step order neeche diya gaya hai. Is sequence ko follow karne se koi file corrupt nahi hogi aur system 100% plug-and-play banega.
Phase 1: SSD Flashing & First Boot (5 Minutes)
Step 1: Batocera Image Download Karein. Apne Windows PC par Batocera.linux ke official page se Desktop / Laptop (x86_64) version ki .img.gz file download karein.
Step 2: BalenaEtcher Se Flash Karein. Apni NVMe SSD ko metal enclosure mein lagakar PC se connect karein. BalenaEtcher open karein, downloaded image select karein, target mein apni external SSD chunein, aur Flash! par click karein (USB 3.2 par sirf 2–3 minute lagenge).
Step 3: First Boot & Partition Expansion. Flashing ke baad Windows par koi "Format Disk" pop-up aaye toh Cancel dabayein. Ab PC restart karein, Boot Menu (F12/F9/Esc) se apni XPlay SSD select karein, aur Batocera ko pehli baar boot hone dein—yeh automatic aapki poori 500GB/1TB space ko expand kar dega.
Phase 2: Steam & Epic Games Setup (5 Minutes)
Batocera boot hone ke baad keyboard par F1 dabayein (File Manager khul jayega), phir Applications > Xterm (terminal) open karein aur yeh commands run karein:
Step 4: Steam Install & Configure Karein.
Terminal mein type karein: flatpak install flathub com.valvesoftware.Steam -y
Installation ke baad flatpak run com.valvesoftware.Steam chala kar Steam open karein, Settings > Compatibility mein jakar Enable Steam Play for all other titles on karein, aur Proton Experimental select karein. (Test ke baad Steam se sign out karna na bhulein).
Step 5: Heroic Games Launcher (Epic Games) Install Karein.
Terminal mein type karein: flatpak install flathub com.heroicgameslauncher.hgl -y
Heroic open karke Wine Manager mein jayein aur latest Proton-GE download karke default set kar dein.
Step 6: Main Screen Par Shortcuts Banayein.
/userdata/roms/ports/ folder ke andar do text files banayein: Steam.sh aur Epic_Games.sh.
Steam.sh mein likhein: flatpak run com.valvesoftware.Steam -bigpicture
Epic_Games.sh mein likhein: flatpak run com.heroicgameslauncher.hgl
Terminal mein chmod +x /userdata/roms/ports/*.sh run karein taaki dono main menu mein dikhne lagein.
Phase 3: XPlay UI, Splash & Security Lock (5 Minutes)
Step 7: Custom Boot Splash Lagayein. Apni 3–5 second ki 1080p .mp4 XPlay boot video ko /userdata/splash/ folder mein paste karein aur purani default files delete kar dein.
Step 8: XPlay Theme Apply Karein. Apni edited theme folder (xplay-ui) ko /userdata/themes/ mein copy karein. Batocera menu (Start button) mein jakar User Interface Settings > Theme Set > xplay-ui select karein.
Step 9: Dedicated GPU Enable Karein. /userdata/system/batocera.conf file open karein aur nvidia-driver=true aur nvidia-prime=true ke aage se # hata dein taaki gaming laptops par dedicated GPU automatic chale.
Step 10: Kiosk Mode & Password Lock. Terminal mein passwd likh kar naya root password set karein. Phir Batocera menu mein System Settings > User Interface Mode ko Kiosk par set kar dein taaki customer galti se system files delete na kar sake.
Master Image Backup (Future Orders Ke Liye)
Jab yeh ek SSD 100% test ho jaye, toh ise wapas Windows PC se lagayein aur Win32 Disk Imager ya USB Image Tool se is poori SSD ki ek .img backup file apne PC mein save kar lein.
Agla order aane par aapko yeh 10 steps dobara nahi karne padenge—bas 3 minute mein woh .img file nayi SSD par clone karni hogi!
Prototype test karte waqt agar kisi step mein error aaye ya Win32 Disk Imager se Master Image clone karne ka exact tareeka chahiye ho, toh mujhe batana—main help kar doonga!




humare brand ka color kya rhega
XPlay ke liye sabse strong aur commercial brand color palette Matte Black + Electric Cyan (#00F0FF) + Solar Amber (#FF9500) rahega.
Yeh color combination aapko Sony PlayStation (Blue) aur Xbox (Green) se bilkul alag apni ek original, futuristic gaming identity dega—aur aapke matte-black metal SSD enclosure par bhi sabse zyada premium lagega.
1. XPlay Signature Color Palette
Primary Base — Matte Obsidian Black (#0B0D10): Box packaging, UI background, aur website ka base color. Dark UI TV aur laptop screens par aankhon ko chubhta nahi hai aur console jaisa luxury feel deta hai.
Primary Accent — Electric Cyan (#00F0FF): Logo highlight, UI selection borders, aur boot splash glow ke liye. Yeh high-tech, fast-speed (10Gbps SSD), aur modern PC gaming ko represent karta hai.
Secondary Highlight — Solar Amber (#FF9500): "Limited Launch Offer", "VIP GTA 5 Card", aur website ke "Buy Now" buttons ke liye. Dark black background par amber/orange button sabse zyada clicks laata hai.
Clean Text — Pure Crisp White (#F5F7FA): Game titles, setup guide cards, aur UI menus ke liye taaki padhne mein bilkul clear rahe.
2. Yeh Colors Kahan-Kahan Use Karne Hain
Metal SSD Enclosure Par: Matte black aluminum enclosure par sirf Pure White + Electric Cyan mein XPlay ka logo print/engrave karwayein.
Packaging Box Par: Matte black rigid box par UV-gloss Electric Cyan mein logo aur Solar Amber strip par tagline ("Any PC. Instant Console.").
Batocera Theme (theme.xml) Mein: Purane PlayStation blue (#003791) ko replace karke #00F0FF (selection glow) aur #0B0D10 (background) set karein.
Cosmic Byte Controller Match: Agar aap Cosmic Byte ARES (Black) le rahe hain, toh uski LED lights ko bhi cyan/white par set karke bhej sakte hain taaki poora kit ek hi brand ka lage!
