agr maine renew nhi krway to ye log mera domain sell kr denege kisi aur ko ?
Haan, agar aap expiry date ke baad domain renew nahi karwate hain, toh ek fixed grace period (approx. 60–75 din) ke baad woh domain public ke liye wapas available ho jata hai aur koi bhi aur insaan use kharid sakta hai.
Lekin aapke domain ke expire hote hi agle hi din kisi aur ko nahi becha jata—uske peeche ek poora 3-step timeline hota hai:
Domain Expire Hone Ke Baad Kya Hota Hai?
1. Renewal Grace Period (0 se 30 Din): Expiry date nikalne ke baad aapki website band ho jati hai, lekin agle 30 din tak aap bina kisi extra fine ke normal renewal price dekar apna domain wapas chalu kar sakte hain.
2. Redemption Period (30 se 60 Din): Agar 30 din mein bhi renew nahi kiya, toh domain "Redemption" mein chala jata hai. Is dauran koi aur ise nahi kharid sakta, lekin aapko wapas lene ke liye renewal ke saath ek bada late fee (approx. ₹5,000–₹8,000) dena padta hai.
3. Pending Delete & Public Release (60 se 75 Din): Iske baad domain delete hokar wapas open market mein aa jata hai—aur tab koi bhi competitor ya domain investor use normal price par kharid sakta hai.
Aapke Business Ke Liye Important Tip
Brand Chalne Par Auto-Renew On Rakhein: Agar xplayconsole.com par aapke customers ban gaye hain aur business chal raha hai, toh Auto-Renew hamesha on rakhein (sirf ₹1,000–₹1,400 saal ka kharcha hai). Agar aapne renew nahi kiya aur kisi aur ne kharid liya, toh aapke purane customers aur Google/Instagram links uske paas chale jayenge.
Agar Business Band Karna Ho: Agar 1 saal baad aapko lage ki yeh project aage nahi badhana hai, toh bas Auto-Renew off kar dein—aap par koi penalty nahi lagegi aur domain apne aap expire ho jayega.
