seal kaisa rhega and kaise usko tamper proof bnayenge hum
Enclosure ko tamper-proof banane ke liye aapko "VOID" Tamper-Evident Security Stickers (jise Ultra-Destructible Eggshell Stickers ya Holographic VOID Seals bhi kehte hain) use karne chahiye.
Jab koi insaan inhe enclosure ke sliding joint ya screw ke upar se utaarne ki koshish karta hai, toh yeh do tarah se kaam karte hain:
1. Seal Kaisa Hona Chahiye (2 Best Types)
Type A: "VOID" Residue Security Sticker (Best for Metal Enclosures):
Kaise Kaam Karta Hai: Yeh ek patla glossy/holographic sticker hota hai. Jab tak chipka hai, is par aapka XPlay logo aur "WARRANTY VOID IF REMOVED" likha dikhta hai.
Tamper Proof Magic: Jaise hi koi ise nakhun ya blade se utaarne ki koshish karta hai, sticker ke neeche se aluminum body par "VOID / OPENED" likha hua permanent nishan chhap jata hai—aur sticker dobara chipak nahi pata.
Type B: Ultra-Destructible Eggshell Sticker:
Kaise Kaam Karta Hai: Yeh ande ke chhilke (eggshell) jaisa nazuk hota hai. Agar koi ise utaarega toh yeh ek saath nahi niklega, balki chhote-chhote tukdon (pieces) mein toot kar bikhar jayega—jisse dobara lagana namumkin ho jata hai.
2. Enclosure Par Kahan Aur Kaise Lagayein
Sliding / Screw Joint Par: PiBOX ya Techie ke metal enclosure mein jis taraf se tray khulti hai (ya jahan chhota screw lagta hai), wahan sticker ko L-shape (Wrap-Around) mein chipkayein—yani aadha sticker aluminum body par rahe aur aadha sliding cap/screw ke upar.
Lagaane Se Pehle Clean Karein: Sticker chipkane se pehle metal enclosure ke us hisse ko ek sookhe kapde ya sanitizer/alcohol wipe se saaf kar lein taaki oil ya dhool na rahe—is se adhesive 100% mazbooti se chipak jayega.
