inme se koi shi hai kya ?
Aapke ₹9,999 ke selling price ke hisab se Amazon ki is list mein se koi bhi 512GB SSD lena profitable nahi hai—kyunki yahan sabse sasti NVMe SSD bhi ₹7,499 ki hai.
Agar aap Amazon se ₹7,500–₹8,300 ki SSD kharidenge, toh Enclosure (₹800) + Controller (₹1,150) + Packaging/Courier (₹350) milakar aapki cost hi ₹9,800 – ₹10,600 pahunch jayegi, aur aapka profit zero ho jayega.
1. Is List Mein Technical Quality Kiski Achhi Hai?
Agar price ko side mein rakhein, toh is list mein sirf yeh options technically reliable hain:
Hikvision E3000 512GB (₹7,599) & Patriot P300 512GB (₹9,049): Dono proper PCIe Gen 3x4 NVMe drives hain (3,500 MB/s tak speed) aur external enclosure mein achha chalti hain.
Crucial E100 480GB (₹9,399) & WD Blue SN5100 500GB (₹12,800): Brand reliability aur warranty mein best hain, lekin price bahut zyada hai.
Kisko Bilkul Mat Lena: EVM 512GB M.2 SATA (₹6,299) mat lena kyunki woh slow SATA drive hai, aur Consistent / Zebronics ko avoid karein kyunki inki NAND quality aur RMA support weak hota hai.
2. Aapko Ab Kya Karna Chahiye? (2 Practical Raaste)
2026 mein SSD ke market rates sach mein kaafi badh gaye hain. Isliye loss se bachne ke liye aapke paas sirf 2 hi raaste hain:
Raasta 1: Pehle Nehru Place (Delhi) Ka Offline Rate Check Karein. Amazon par sellers 15–20% commission aur shipping jod kar bechte hain. Nehru Place mein Cost to Cost ya SMC International par jakar dekhein ki 500GB NVMe SSD cash rate par kitne ki mil rahi hai. Agar wahan ₹5,000–₹5,500 mein mile tabhi ₹9,999 ka price rakhein.
Raasta 2: Apna Selling Price Market Rate Ke Hisab Se Update Karein. Agar Nehru Place mein bhi 500GB SSD ₹7,000+ ki hi mil rahi hai, toh apne XPlay 500GB Console ka price ₹9,999 se badha kar ₹12,499 ya ₹12,999 kar dein (aur shuru mein free game key ki jagah pre-installed free-to-play games dein). Jab pure market mein SSD aur laptops mehnge ho gaye hain, toh customer ₹12,999 bhi dega!
Abhi Ke Liye Sabse Safe Step
Abhi ek bhi rupaya kharch mat karo—pehle apni 500GB testing HDD par XPlay OS setup karke reels shoot karo, aur ek chakkar Nehru Place lagakar offline SSD rate confirm kar lo.
