Aapne jo Amazon list dikhayi thi, usme se quality, speed, heat control, aur warranty ke hisab se yeh 3 SSDs sabse best hain (bilkul genuine aur reliable):
1. Western Digital WD Blue SN5100 500GB NVMe (WDS500G5B0E) — #1 Best Quality
Kyon Best Hai: Western Digital gaming aur heavy workloads ke liye sabse bharosemand brand hai. Isme 6,600 MB/s tak ki speed aur 5-Year WD India Warranty milti hai.
Thermal & Stability: External aluminum enclosure mein lambe gaming sessions (GTA 5 / RDR2) ke dauran bhi yeh drive hang ya disconnect nahi hoti.
2. Crucial E100 480GB PCIe Gen4 NVMe (CT480E100SSD8) — #2 Best Value & Cool Running
Kyon Best Hai: Crucial (Micron) ki drives apne low power consumption ke liye jaani jaati hain—matlab external USB case mein yeh bahut kam garam hoti hain.
Reliability: 4,700 MB/s read speed aur pan-India easy RMA service milti hai.
3. SanDisk Optimus 5100 500GB NVMe (SDSP51500GAN-000E0) — #3 Top Alternative
Kyon Best Hai: SanDisk aur WD ek hi parent company ke hain, isliye isme bhi wahi top-tier NAND flash aur 5-Year Warranty milti hai. Agar WD Blue stock mein na mile toh yeh best option hai.
Jinhe Aapko Bilkul Avoid Karna Hai (Quality Bachane Ke Liye)
EVM, Consistent, Zebronics, Foxin: In local/rebranded SSDs mein DRAM-less sasta controller hota hai jo GTA 5 jaise bade 110GB games write/load karte waqt bahut garam hokar slow (thermal throttle) ho jata hai—isliye WD, Crucial, ya SanDisk ke alawa koi aur brand mat lena.
