isse bhi kuch farak pdta hai ?
Haan bhai, enclosure (cover) se bahut bada farak padta hai—agar galat enclosure le liya toh aapka ₹9,399 ka Crucial SSD ya toh kaam hi nahi karega, ya game khelte waqt beech mein disconnect ho jayega.
Enclosure ke andar ek chhota sa controller microchip (bridge chip) aur cooling system hota hai, jo poore console ki stability decide karta hai. Neeche 4 main kaaran hain ki enclosure se kya-kya farak padta hai:
1. Compatibility (SSD Chalegi Ya Nahi)
NVMe vs. SATA: Saste ₹400–₹500 wale enclosures sirf M.2 SATA ke liye hote hain. Unme aapki Crucial E100 NVMe SSD fit hi nahi hogi ya laptop mein detect nahi hogi. Isliye 10Gbps NVMe enclosure lena zaroori hai.
2. Heat & Game Lag (Aluminum vs. Plastic)
Thermal Throttling: GTA 5 jaise heavy games lagatar SSD se data read karte hain, jisse NVMe chip 60°C–70°C tak garam ho jati hai.
Aluminum Body Ka Fayda: Sounce / PiBOX jaise metal (aluminum) enclosures thermal pad ke zariye SSD ki garmi bahar nikal dete hain—jisse game 3–4 ghante lagatar khelne par bhi lag ya hang nahi hota. Plastic cover mein SSD garam hokar slow ho jati hai.
3. Linux / Batocera Disconnect Issue (Chipset Ka Khel)
Realtek RTL9210 Chipset: Saste non-branded enclosures mein JMicron ki purani chip hoti hai, jo Linux (Batocera) par sleep mode mein jaakar beech game mein disconnect ho jati hai.
Sounce (₹719) aur PiBOX (₹796) dono mein Realtek RTL9210 chipset laga hota hai—jo Linux/Batocera ke saath 100% stable chalta hai aur UASP + TRIM support deta hai (jisse SSD ki life aur speed dono bani rehti hai).
4. Cable Quality (Speed Drop)
Ek achhe enclosure ke saath 10Gbps data-rated braided USB-C aur USB-A cables milti hain. Sasti cable lagane par speed 1,000 MB/s se gir kar 40 MB/s (USB 2.0) par aa jati hai, jisse GTA 5 load hone mein 5 minute lag jayenge.
Seedha Conclusion
Enclosure sirf ek plastic/metal ka dabba nahi hai, balki aapke XPlay Console ka engine hai—isliye ₹719 wala Sounce ya ₹796 wala PiBOX (Realtek RTL9210) hi lena, usse sasta koi ₹400 wala mat lena.
Kya aap chahte hain ki main ab Cosmic Byte ARES White Wireless Controller ka bhi direct buying link de doon, ya ab hum 500GB testing HDD par XPlay OS setup shuru karein?




