आपका अंदाज़ा बिल्कुल सही है bhai—technical reliability aur customer experience ke hisab se Crucial X9 1TB Portable External SSD (₹17,999) aapke खुद के assemble kiye hue SSD + Cover se zyada strong aur reliable hai, bas ek chhota sa branding aur cost ka trade-off hai.
Dono options ka seedha comparison samajh lo taaki aap sahi faisla le sako:
1. Crucial X9 1TB Portable SSD (Photo Wali) Ke Fayde (Pros)
Zero Assembly & Zero Disconnect Risk: Yeh factory-sealed portable SSD hai—isliye aapko enclosure kholne, thermal pad chipkane, ya loose connection hone ki koi tension nahi rahegi.
Drop & Dust Resistant: Crucial X9 2-meter (7.5 feet) tak girne par bhi kharab nahi hoti, jabki metal enclosure girne par andar ki NVMe SSD hil sakti hai.
5-Year Warranty & 1,050 MB/s Speed: Speed bilkul same (1,050 MB/s) milti hai aur Crucial ki 5-Year Warranty milti hai (Crucial E100 mein 3-Year thi).
Cost Lagbhag Same Hai: Crucial E100 1TB (₹16,219) + Enclosure (₹1,000) = ₹17,219 padta tha, aur Crucial X9 bank discount ke baad ~₹16,749 – ₹17,999 mein seedha ready-made aa rahi hai!
2. Isme Kya Chhoti Si Kami Hai (Cons)
Upar "Crucial" Likha Hoga: Is drive par bada sa Crucial ka logo print hota hai—isliye customer ko turant pata chal jayega ki yeh ek Crucial external SSD hai jisme aapne OS daala hai (halanki back side par aap apna XPlay sticker aur Void seal laga sakte hain).
Sirf USB-C Cable Saath Aati Hai: Crucial X9 ke box mein sirf USB-C to USB-C cable aati hai—purane laptops (jinme sirf normal bada USB-A port hota hai) ke liye aapko ₹100 ka ek USB-C to USB-A adapter box mein alag se daalna padega.
Final Verdict (Kya Karna Chahiye?)
1TB Pro Variant (₹27,999) Ke Liye Crucial X9 1TB Le Lo: Yeh bahut zyada durable, factory-sealed, aur 5-Year warranty wali drive hai—bas ₹100 ka ek USB-A adapter saath rakh dena aur peeche apna XPlay badge laga dena.
480GB Variant (₹18,499) Ke Liye: Pehle wala Crucial E100 480GB + Metal Enclosure hi rakho taaki aapka ₹18,499 wala price point aur profit margin bana rahe.
अब आपके पास दोनों वेरिएंट्स के लिए सबसे सटीक हार्डवेयर फाइनल हो चुका है—क्या आप अब अपनी 500GB टेस्टिंग HDD पर XPlay OS सेटअप शुरू करने जा रहे हैं, या मैं आपके पहले लॉन्च वीडियो का कैप्शन और हैशटैग्स लिख दूँ?




